      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues and EPS in line with analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.29 (up from ₹7.28 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹276.1b (up 16% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹60.6b (up 14% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) were also in line with analyst expectations. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 17% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 56% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
