      "body": "Dividend of ₹1.95 is 30% higher than last year. Ex-date: 6th March 2026 Payment date: 29th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.6%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.9%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (11% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (184% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 23% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 35% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
